---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { COMPANY, CONTACT_EMAIL, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<Page title={`Privacy — ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="How Bioluma Labs handles privacy on this website and in our games and apps, including optional ads in the Capy Sports Club app.">
	<h1>Privacy</h1>
	<p class="lede">
		The short version: we don't collect your data. There are no accounts and no tracking, on this
		website or in our games and apps. This website and the games you play on it have no ads. The
		app versions of Capy Sports Club show optional ads, only when a player chooses to watch one;
		<a href="#capy-sports-club-app">details below</a>.
	</p>
	<p class="updated">Last updated 30 September 2026</p>

	<h2>What we don't do</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>We don't ask for names, email addresses, ages or any other personal details.</li>
		<li>There are no accounts, logins or sign-ups.</li>
		<li>We don't use analytics, tracking pixels or third-party cookies.</li>
		<li>We don't show ads on this website or in the games you play on it.</li>
		<li>We never use personalised or targeted advertising, anywhere.</li>
		<li>We don't share or sell data to anyone.</li>
		<li>There is no chat or messaging, and players can't contact each other.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>What stays on your device</h2>
	<p>
		Our games and apps save things like progress, settings (such as sound on or off), unlocked characters and
		any names a player gives them. They save these on your device, in your browser's storage or the app's own storage.
		That information never leaves the device and we can't see it. You can delete it at any time by
		clearing this site's data in your browser settings or, for an app, by deleting the app.
	</p>

	<h2 id="capy-sports-club-app">Ads and purchases in the Capy Sports Club app</h2>
	<p>
		The Capy Sports Club app (coming to the App Store and Google Play) works differently from the
		games on this website in two ways.
	</p>
	<h3>Optional ads</h3>
	<ul>
		<li>
			An ad only plays when a player taps a button that says what they'll get for watching it, such
			as double rewards or a daily bonus. Ads never play on their own, and never in the middle of a
			game.
		</li>
		<li>There is a daily limit on how many ads can be watched.</li>
		<li>
			Ads are provided by Google AdMob. We set them up as child-directed, non-personalised and
			suitable for general audiences, so they are not based on a player's interests or on what they
			do in other apps.
		</li>
		<li>
			To show an ad and keep it free of fraud, Google receives basic technical information from the
			device, such as its IP address and device type. Google's handling of that information is
			described in <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads">how Google uses information in advertising</a>.
			We don't receive it.
		</li>
	</ul>
	<h3>An optional purchase</h3>
	<p>
		The app offers one optional purchase, the Full Club, which opens every sport and removes all ads.
		A grown-up has to answer a simple question before any purchase can start. Payment is handled
		entirely by Apple or Google; we never see payment details.
	</p>
	<p>
		If a purchase is made, it's recorded by RevenueCat, a service we use to check that the purchase
		is genuine and to restore it on a new device or after reinstalling. RevenueCat receives a random
		ID created by the app (not linked to a name, email or account) and the purchase record from Apple
		or Google, plus basic technical information such as the device type. It doesn't receive any
		payment details.
	</p>

	<h2>Hosting</h2>
	<p>
		This website and our games and apps are served by Cloudflare. As with any website, Cloudflare handles
		basic technical information (such as your IP address and browser type) so it can deliver pages
		and protect the site from abuse. We don't use that information to identify, profile or track
		anyone.
	</p>

	<h2>Made for children</h2>
	<p>
		Our games and apps are made for children, and we've designed them to need no personal information at
		all. Where a game has ads, they are child-directed and never personalised. If you are under 13, please ask a parent or carer to email us for you. If we ever receive
		personal information about a child by mistake, we will delete it.
	</p>

	<h2>If you email us</h2>
	<p>
		If you email us, we use your email address and message only to reply to you, and we delete
		them once they are no longer needed.
	</p>

	<h2>Questions</h2>
	<p>
		{SITE_TITLE} is a trading name of {COMPANY}, which owns and is responsible for this website and
		our games and apps.
		If you have any question about privacy,
		email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
	</p>
	<p>If we change how any of this works, we'll update this page and the date at the top.</p>
</Page>
